  "summary": {
    "text": "Command A is an enterprise-focused language model in Cohere's Command family with 111 billion parameters and a 256K-token context window, offered on the Cohere API and as research-use open weights on Hugging Face. Cohere positions it for tool use, agents, retrieval-augmented generation with citations and business tasks in 23 languages.",
